spice
* Component Definitions
* L - Inductor
LP 5 2 5uH

* R - Resistor
RP 2 4 1k

* C - Capacitor
CP 5 3 10pF

* M - MOSFET
* NMOS: Drain - Gate - Source
M1 4 1 4 4 NMOS

* Voltage Source
VDD 2 0 DC 5V

* Input Voltage
Vin 1 0 DC 0V

* Output
Vout 4

* Model Definition
.model NMOS NMOS (LEVEL=1 KP=120u VTO=1.0)

* End of Netlist